      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Miu Miu has launched a collection of crocodile-embossed leather bags this week, starring three mini styles: the Arcadie, Beau, and Aventure. Crafted from glossy calfskin stamped with a luxurious crocodile texture, the bags are rendered in retro hues like cocoa brown, antique pink, and cherry red, lending them an air of elegant sweetness.",
