      "text": "The Aventure mini bag takes on a structured, rounded, compact shell shape, with a belt-buckle strap as its signature design, evoking a vintage refinement. The crocodile-embossed calfskin adds a luxurious touch, and it comes in three colorways: white for the most fresh and refined look; antique pink for an elegant yet coquettish femininity; and cocoa brown for the strongest vintage feel, also ideal for autumn and winter styling.",
